              "text": "Six friends play a game. Their mean score in the game is 19.",
              "marks": []
            },
            {
              "type": "break"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "The mean score of four of the friends is 24. Find the mean score of the remaining two friends.",
              "marks": []
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
